Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: pattern_queries (validates ADR 0013)
Purpose:
    Exercise the four ADR 0013 query methods on a post-naming mixed
    graph. Confirm classification of fresh subgraphs against the
    registry, membership reporting, and instance reconstruction all
    behave as specified. This is the first time meta-R is read
    from — the first step where the β layer pays rent.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0013 (classify_subgraph, pattern_of, memberships_of,
    instance_subgraph). No changes to the naming pipeline.
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0013.
    Runner: v2/examples/pattern_queries.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example pattern_queries

====================================================================
RAW OUTPUT
====================================================================

=== Registered patterns ===
  p_0 — 1 instance(s)
    p_0_i_0  sg: {R(k1,k2), R(k2,k3), R(k3,k1)}  canon: [(0, 0), (0, 0), (0, 0)]
  p_1 — 1 instance(s)
    p_1_i_0  sg: {R(s,sa), R(s,sb), R(s,sc)}  canon: [(1, 0), (1, 0), (1, 0)]
  p_2 — 1 instance(s)
